# Project Awareness & Context Rules

- **Always read @PLANNING.md** at the start of a new conversation to understand project architecture.
- **Check @TASK.md before starting a new task.** If not listed, add it with a brief description and date.
- **Never create a file longer than 500 lines of code.** Refactor by splitting into sub-modules.
- **Mark completed tasks in @TASK.md immediately.**
- **Add discovered sub-tasks to @TASK.md** under `### Discovered During Work`.
- **Log new mistakes to @things-to-avoid.mdc**.
